# flagship — the hero: one small feature, written, reviewed and ready to ship.
#
# What using Luxe looks like, at the speed it happens: a request, the agent reading its way in, an
# edit with its diff, the tests really run, and a reply that says what changed. Then the part no
# other agent has: the change read back as a Guided Review, a chapter at a time, and finished into a
# pull request drafted from it. Nothing is staged and nothing is sped up; only the dead air between
# frames is trimmed. The take ends on the draft and never opens it.
#
# The repository is fictional, so `gh` is a stand-in (`gh/gh`) that answers for `acme/todo`: it
# says the branch has no pull request yet, which is what makes the review offer to open one. The
# work happens on a branch of its own, since a pull request from `main` into `main` is refused.
#
# The two waits on a model that are not dead air, the guide being written and the pull request
# being drafted, are marked `squeeze`…`resume`: `cast-edit.py` plays each in two seconds, every
# frame kept, and the clock on screen still says how long it took.
#
# The recorder starts Luxe with the dashboard off, so a take opens on the session itself rather
# than on three seconds of a splash screen it is not about.

#: cols 120
#: rows 32
#: speed 1.0
#: model anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
#: thinking medium
#: glyphs nerd
#: bin gh
#: setup git remote add origin https://github.com/acme/todo.git && git checkout -q -b todo-overdue

# A modal waiting on a person looks exactly like a finished turn, and strands the take. Both
# the permission panel and the question tool get answered a beat after they appear.
answer Return hold 3 when Allow once
answer Return hold 3.5 when Enter submit

sleep 3
mark start
sleep 1.2

enter add a `todo overdue` command: open tasks past their due date, oldest first. with a test

log the turn — over when the screen stops changing
settle 6 max 420

log the review: Ctrl+G writes its guide, and once it says it is ready, Ctrl+G opens it
sleep 2
mod ctrl g
sleep 1
mark squeeze-guide
expect review ready max 180
mark resume-guide
sleep 1.5
mod ctrl g
expect space next max 30
settle 2 max 60
sleep 4.5
key space
sleep 4.5
key space
sleep 3

log finish, into a pull request
mod alt Return
expect Open pull request max 15
sleep 2
key Down x4
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 1
mark squeeze-draft
log the draft
expect Title max 120
mark resume-draft
settle 2 max 60
sleep 4
mark end
